\f1\b T
\f0\b0 ) ja laskee sen kinemaattisen viskositeetin (
\f1\b nu
\f0\b0 ).\
\ls2\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
